graph LR
    Prism["llm-d Prism<br/>Express BFF + React SPA"]

    %% Runtime / platform dependencies
    Prism -->|runtime| Node["Node.js 26<br/>node:26-alpine"]
    Prism -->|HTTP server| Express["express ^4.18.2<br/>express-rate-limit, compression"]
    Prism -->|GCS client| GCSLib["@google-cloud/storage ^7.21.0"]
    Prism -->|ADC tokens| GAuth["google-auth-library ^9.4.1"]
    Prism -->|payload validation| Zod["zod ^4.4.3"]
    Prism -->|UI| React["react 19, recharts,<br/>tailwindcss 4, lucide-react"]

    %% External SaaS
    Prism -->|"hosting, TLS, autoscaling"| CloudRun["Google Cloud Run"]
    Prism -->|"Results Store, allowlists,<br/>benchmark data (HTTPS/443)"| GCS["Google Cloud Storage"]
    Prism -->|"profiles + cost<br/>(HTTPS/443, optional)"| GIQ["GKE Inference Quickstart API"]
    Prism -->|"identity, org membership<br/>(HTTPS/443)"| GitHub["GitHub OAuth + REST"]

    %% Internal llm-d data producers
    Harness["llm-d benchmark harnesses<br/>llm-d-benchmark / inference-perf"] -.->|"BRv0.2 reports<br/>(data format)"| Prism

    %% Integration points (consumers)
    Agent["AI coding agents /<br/>prism-results CLI"] -->|"Results API + skill manifests<br/>(HTTPS/443)"| Prism
    Browser["Browser users"] -->|"dashboards (HTTPS/443)"| Prism
    Browser -.->|client-side| ClientSrc["S3 / Google Drive /<br/>Google Analytics"]

    %% Non-runtime artifacts
    Prism -.->|"template stub, not shipped"| GoStub["cmd/main.go (Go 1.24)"]
    Prism -.->|offline script| PyTool["tools/update_arena_scores.py"]

    Note["No ODH/RHOAI runtime, CRD<br/>or image dependency"]

